#
# Each case exists because a specific mis-route actually happened. That is the whole
# point of a regression case and it is exactly why these must never be averaged into
# the A/B number in desc-routing.jsonl: selecting cases by outcome guarantees the
# result, so a measurement set may not contain them (sota-llm-engineering rules/01 §8).
