{"id": "r4_powershell_windows_ci", "task": "Our Windows deployment step is a PowerShell script that calls terraform and docker. It sets $ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop' but the job still goes green when terraform fails. Review the script.", "expect": "sota-shell-scripting", "distractor": "sota-devsecops"}
